      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm typing this. i just found out the whole dataset for my dissertation is corrupted. like, irrecoverably. years of work just gone. i feel like such a fraud. i can't even think about facing my advisor or my lab mates. everything i thought i was building... it's just nothing. it's all for nothing.",
